>> a := Lista ← Oġġett ; Veru ; Falz ; Boolean ; 1 ; Numru ; ['Str'] ; Test ; { ['Empty']. }.
Ħruġ ikteb: (a għodd), linja-ġdida.
{ :i
	Ħruġ ikteb: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) tip) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Xejn?) jew: [''] jew: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	linja-ġdida.
} × (a għodd).
Ħruġ ikteb: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Xejn Xejn?) jew: ['certainly NIL!'] jew: ['not NIL??']), linja-ġdida.